B.a23=new A.aI("1.0.37","G\xfcncelleme ekran\u0131: tam ekran b\xfcy\xfck y\xfczde (RideAtlas/GPX tarz\u0131).","Update screen: full-screen large percent (RideAtlas/GPX style).","Update-Bildschirm: gro\xdfer Prozentwert im Vollbild (RideAtlas/GPX-Stil).")
B.a25=new A.aI("1.0.36","Tek tu\u015f g\xfcncelleme: ara s\xfcr\xfcm yok, do\u011frudan en son APK; indirmede y\xfczde g\xf6sterilir.","One-tap update: jump straight to latest APK (no intermediate versions); download shows %.","Ein-Tipp-Update: direkt neueste APK (keine Zwischenversionen); Download zeigt %.")
B.a1w=new A.aI("1.0.35","Sabit indirme: android-latest/MedyaAtlas.apk; web ayn\u0131 adrese yaz\u0131l\u0131r (s\xfcr\xfcm klas\xf6r\xfc yok).","Stable download: android-latest/MedyaAtlas.apk; web overwrites same URL (no version folders).","Fester Download: android-latest/MedyaAtlas.apk; Web \xfcberschreibt dieselbe URL.")
B.a1H=new A.aI("1.0.34","GPX se\xe7icide yaln\u0131zca Dosyalar (galeri/kamera yok); web videolar uygulama i\xe7inde oynar.","GPX picker shows Files only (no gallery/camera); web videos play in-app.","GPX-Auswahl nur Dateien (keine Galerie/Kamera); Web-Videos in der App.")
