B.a2d=new A.aI("1.0.26","\xd6l\xfc blob URL yok: sekmeyi kapat\u0131nca k\u0131r\u0131k ikon yerine \xabyeniden se\xe7in\xbb; blob indeksine yaz\u0131lmaz.","No dead blob URLs: after closing the tab you get \u201creselect\u201d, not a broken icon; blobs stay out of the index.","Keine toten Blob-URLs: nach Tab-Schlie\xdfung \u201eerneut ausw\xe4hlen\u201c statt kaputtem Icon; Blobs nicht im Index.")
